  'f.bikeseason': ['Bikes › Care › a bike › «Wear» › «Winter and spring».', 'Tick the points; add, rename, move or delete them.', 'The ticks are per bike and season.'],
  'f.noises': ['Bikes › Care › a bike › «Wear» › «Noises»: describe it.', 'Tips from the bike FAQ show below it.', 'After a change the app asks «Is the noise gone?».'],
  'f.carestreak': ['Bikes › Care › a bike › «Wear»: the line below the rain hint.', 'Care the same day or the next counts.', 'A wet day without care starts a new series.'],
  'f.wearcal': ['Me › Connections › Calendar «Packgenerator».', 'Switch on «Part changes of your bikes».', 'The evening before at 18:00 your phone reminds you.'],
